          <br />
          typing "FUCK" or "WTF" at the start of a new line colors your text red <br />
          or you can wrap [r] [/r] around a selection of text to color it red: <br>
          <div
            style="
               background-image: linear-gradient(var(--panel), var(--gradient));
              border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
              padding: 5px;
              margin-top: 5px;
            "
