            <span class="shake-1"><h2>DUDE WHY DID YOU TELL ME TO READ LIAR GAME? WHAT THE FUCK WAS THAT ENDING?!?!?</h2></span>
          </div>
          <br />
        
          
          typing "..!", "...!", or "....!" at the end of a line gives you a shake effect of various strengths: <br />
